## STANDING LINES
1. **PRIOR-WORK CHECK, before you edit.** On `332dcc6f`: `git log --oneline -n 8 332dcc6f -- <path>` for the six sources, the spec and the staleCard test; `git log -S'showNext' --oneline 332dcc6f -- web/src web/e2e` (positive control `-S'NextStep'` prints at least 1; zero control `-S'zzz-no-such-string-7f3a'` prints nothing); `git grep -n -i -E 'showNext|Previous:' 332dcc6f -- web/src web/e2e` (name every file hit). Jira GET only (`python3 -I -B .tools/b649/jira.py`, read whole first; every JQL begins `project = HPSMPOC AND ( ... )`; credentials in-process; prints no token): `HPSMPOC-378`, `-402`, `-401`, `-371`. Read as claims: the newest STATUS under `1_Project_Definition/Briefs/` that touched these screens (name it) and the B901 and B913 gate STATUS files that raised hand-offs 1 and 2. State what you reuse (`walkJourney`, `ownMockSpace`, `signIn`, `scan`/`noSideScroll`, the session seeding of the existing prototype tests, all by import or copy of pattern) and what you add. **A READY FOR QA without a PRIOR WORK section is returned unread.**
